    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "The PSY401 adapter maximizes the mounting capabilities when using a ScienceDesk with a Faraday cage. It offers seven through holes for post-mounted ScienceDesk accessories. Additionally, this adapter allows for the PSY350 side shelf to be attached to a ScienceDesk frame equipped with an enclosure, providing a large, 755 mm x 600 mm work surface separate from the isolated experiment.",
