    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "While the Faraday cage offers two cable ports on its rear panel, additional ports can be added to any Faraday Cage panel using this cable port kit. Each PSY405 kit enables the creation of an additional port with a clearance of ∅1.75\" (∅44.4 mm).",
